{"seq":2,"slug":"anonymous-login-wishlist-merge","title":"匿名态与登录态心愿单合并、跨设备同步与冲突消解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/wishlist-restock-price-alert-engagement/wishlist-entity-catalog-model/anonymous-login-wishlist-merge","wordCount":2891,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"匿名态与登录态心愿单合并-跨设备同步与冲突消解\">匿名态与登录态心愿单合并、跨设备同步与冲突消解</h1><p>一个用户在手机浏览器上未登录就把三件商品加进心愿单，关掉页面；第二天他在桌面端登录同一账号，打开心愿单却是空的——或者更糟，他手机上加的三件被服务端返回的空列表覆盖掉了。这类事故在跨境电商里格外常见：用户频繁切换设备、网络与登录状态，而匿名态与登录态之间如果没有一条<strong>确定性的合并规则</strong>，收藏数据就会在身份切换的瞬间丢失或重复。本文讨论的就是这条规则怎么设计：匿名心愿单用什么标识、登录时如何以并集语义合并、多设备并发写入时如何消解冲突，以及合并动作在合规上留下的痕迹。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>心愿单数据在生命周期里会处于三种身份状态之一，三者由<strong>谁来标识收藏主体</strong>区分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>标识载体</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n<th>可见范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>匿名态（device-scoped）</td>\n<td>服务端签发的匿名 token（Cookie 或 localStorage）</td>\n<td>随浏览器存储被驱逐或过期</td>\n<td>单一浏览器实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>登录态（account-scoped）</td>\n<td>账号 ID（服务端会话/JWT <code>sub</code>）</td>\n<td>永久，随账号删除而删除</td>\n<td>该账号的所有设备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并中（merging）</td>\n<td>匿名 token + 账号 ID 的临时绑定</td>\n<td>单次合并事务</td>\n<td>单次请求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>合并的本质是<strong>集合的并集（set union）</strong>，而不是覆盖。设匿名集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>、账号已有集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，每件收藏项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 通过一个去重键 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（通常是 <code>variant_id</code> 或 <code>(product_id, variant_id)</code> 的规范化哈希）映射到唯一标识，则合并结果：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>C</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Π</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\{\\, i \\in A \\cup C \\;\\big|\\; \\pi(i) \\notin \\Pi_{del}\\, \\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span></span><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"llap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Π</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Pi_{del}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是墓碑（tombstone）集合——用户在任一设备上<strong>显式删除</strong>过的去重键。没有墓碑，并集会把删除过的商品重新&quot;复活&quot;，这是最容易被忽略的一类合并缺陷。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    ANON[匿名态&lt;br/&gt;token 标识] --&gt;|登录/注册| MERGE{合并事务}&#10;    AUTH[登录态&lt;br/&gt;account_id 标识] --&gt; MERGE&#10;    MERGE --&gt;|并集 + 去重| RESULT[合并后集合 R]&#10;    MERGE --&gt;|写入墓碑| TOMB[(已删除键&lt;br/&gt;tombstone)]&#10;    TOMB -.过滤.-&gt; RESULT&#10;    RESULT --&gt; SYNC[多设备同步]&#10;    SYNC --&gt;|ETag/If-Match| D1[设备 A]&#10;    SYNC --&gt;|ETag/If-Match| D2[设备 B]&#10;    MERGE --&gt;|匿名 token 作废| ANON\">graph TD\n    ANON[匿名态&lt;br/&gt;token 标识] --&gt;|登录/注册| MERGE{合并事务}\n    AUTH[登录态&lt;br/&gt;account_id 标识] --&gt; MERGE\n    MERGE --&gt;|并集 + 去重| RESULT[合并后集合 R]\n    MERGE --&gt;|写入墓碑| TOMB[(已删除键&lt;br/&gt;tombstone)]\n    TOMB -.过滤.-&gt; RESULT\n    RESULT --&gt; SYNC[多设备同步]\n    SYNC --&gt;|ETag/If-Match| D1[设备 A]\n    SYNC --&gt;|ETag/If-Match| D2[设备 B]\n    MERGE --&gt;|匿名 token 作废| ANON</pre><p>不合并不该被自动触发：<strong>&quot;同设备第二次访问&quot;不是合并</strong>，它只是同一个匿名 token 的续期。真正的合并发生在身份从匿名过渡到认证的那一次请求上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"匿名态的标识载体与生命周期\">匿名态的标识载体与生命周期</h2><p>匿名 token 放哪里，决定了它能活多久、会不会丢、跨不跨设备。三种载体各有明确取舍：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>HttpOnly Cookie</strong>：服务端可设 <code>Secure</code>、<code>SameSite=Lax</code>、<code>HttpOnly</code>，JS 读不到，抗 XSS 窃取。代价是随域名走，跨子域要靠 <code>Domain</code> 属性共享，且用户清 Cookie 就没了。</li>\n<li><strong>localStorage</strong>：前端可直接读写，适合做&quot;离线草稿 + 登录后提交&quot;。但它属于浏览器**存储桶（storage bucket）**的一部分，默认是 <em>best-effort</em> 保留策略——磁盘压力下浏览器可不警告直接清掉整个桶。想让它更难被清，必须显式调用 <code>navigator.storage.persist()</code> 拿到 <em>persistent</em> 模式（MDN Storage API，<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Storage_API）。即便如此，用户主动&quot;清除站点数据&quot;仍会清空它，**只靠\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Storage_API）。即便如此，用户主动&quot;清除站点数据&quot;仍会清空它，**只靠</a> localStorage 的匿名心愿单一定会丢**。</li>\n<li><strong>设备 ID + 服务端匿名档案</strong>：用指纹或首次生成的 ID 在服务端建匿名记录，跨 Cookie 清除存活。跨境场景下这通常和隐私法规冲突，需要谨慎。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2026 年一个必须计入的因素是<strong>存储分区（storage partitioning）</strong>：当一个源被嵌到不同的第三方源里时，浏览器可能为同一个源维护<strong>多个独立的存储桶</strong>（同见 MDN Storage API）。对跨境独立站而言，如果店铺页被嵌在联盟营销 iframe、比价插件或社交 App 的内嵌浏览器里，匿名心愿单写进的是<strong>那个嵌入上下文的桶</strong>，回到顶层域名时读不到——这解释了一类&quot;明明加过却没了&quot;的工单。对策是：匿名态<strong>以服务端 token 为准</strong>，localStorage 只当加速缓存，token 失效时用本地缓存做一次<strong>补偿性重放</strong>。</p>\n<p>匿名 token 的存活窗口应有上界。设签发时刻为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、滑动过期窗口为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，有效条件为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>30</mn><mtext>d</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>180</mn><mtext>d</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{now} \\le t_0 + T_w,\\qquad T_w \\in [30\\text{d},\\,180\\text{d}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">d</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">180</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">d</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>窗口太短，回访用户的心愿单已作废；太长则匿名档案堆积、隐私成本上升。跨境场景常见做法是 90 天滑动 + 服务端可扩展。</p>\n<h2 id=\"登录合并-并集语义与去重\">登录合并：并集语义与去重</h2><p>合并必须<strong>幂等</strong>。同一份匿名数据因为网络重试被提交两次，不能产生重复项或双份通知订阅。这正是 <code>Idempotency-Key</code> 头的用途——IETF 的 <code>draft-ietf-httpapi-idempotency-key-header</code>（作者 Jena / Dalal，2025-10 修订版 <code>-07</code>）把它定义为让 POST/PATCH 这类非幂等方法&quot;容错重试&quot;的请求头（<a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-httpapi-idempotency-key-header/）。合并端点应要求客户端带上它，服务端在窗口内（典型\">https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-httpapi-idempotency-key-header/）。合并端点应要求客户端带上它，服务端在窗口内（典型</a> 24 小时）对同一 key 返回首次结果而非重复执行。</p>\n<p>去重键的选择是合并质量的关键，以下顺序在实践中被证明最稳：优先 <code>variant_id</code>（SKU 级，同款不同色/尺码是不同收藏项）；回退到 <code>(product_id, 规范化属性)</code> 的哈希；绝不使用前端自增 ID 或时间戳做键——它们在跨设备时必然碰撞或错配。</p>\n<p>冲突在合并时是分类型的，不同字段要用不同策略，不能&quot;整条记录二选一&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>冲突字段</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>消解策略</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>是否收藏（成员关系）</td>\n<td>集合成员</td>\n<td>并集（add-wins）</td>\n<td>收藏是正向意图，多设备各自添加都要保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>显式删除</td>\n<td>集合成员</td>\n<td>墓碑过滤（remove-wins on tombstone）</td>\n<td>删除是更强的意图，优先级须高于并集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降价/到货订阅开关</td>\n<td>布尔</td>\n<td>取&quot;任一为真&quot;</td>\n<td>订阅是用户显式开启的通知，宁可多发不可漏发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目标价格阈值</td>\n<td>数值</td>\n<td>最后写入者胜（LWW）</td>\n<td>只保留一个现值，取时间戳最新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>备注/自定义标签</td>\n<td>文本</td>\n<td>追加合并或 LWW</td>\n<td>追加不丢信息，LWW 更简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收藏时间</td>\n<td>时间戳</td>\n<td>取两者较早</td>\n<td>保留最初的兴趣信号，供排序使用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意第一行与第二行的张力：<strong>并集</strong>默认会让集合单调增长，但<strong>墓碑</strong>必须能把它压回去。正确的顺序是&quot;先并集、再用墓碑过滤&quot;，且墓碑本身也要参与同步——否则 A 设备删掉的项会被 B 设备的并集重新写入。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    S[收到合并请求&lt;br/&gt;anon_token + account_id] --&gt; V{anon_token 有效?}&#10;    V --&gt;|否| E[返回 401 / 忽略匿名侧]&#10;    V --&gt;|是| L[读取匿名集合 A 与账号集合 C]&#10;    L --&gt; U[计算并集 A ∪ C&lt;br/&gt;按 π i 去重]&#10;    U --&gt; F[用墓碑集合过滤]&#10;    F --&gt; M[逐字段应用冲突策略]&#10;    M --&gt; W[单事务写入账号集合]&#10;    W --&gt; K[作废匿名 token]&#10;    K --&gt; P[重定向推送订阅&lt;br/&gt;到账号主体]&#10;    P --&gt; R[返回 200 + 合并后的集合]\">flowchart TD\n    S[收到合并请求&lt;br/&gt;anon_token + account_id] --&gt; V{anon_token 有效?}\n    V --&gt;|否| E[返回 401 / 忽略匿名侧]\n    V --&gt;|是| L[读取匿名集合 A 与账号集合 C]\n    L --&gt; U[计算并集 A ∪ C&lt;br/&gt;按 π i 去重]\n    U --&gt; F[用墓碑集合过滤]\n    F --&gt; M[逐字段应用冲突策略]\n    M --&gt; W[单事务写入账号集合]\n    W --&gt; K[作废匿名 token]\n    K --&gt; P[重定向推送订阅&lt;br/&gt;到账号主体]\n    P --&gt; R[返回 200 + 合并后的集合]</pre><p>整个流程必须在<strong>一个事务</strong>内完成：写入账号集合、作废匿名 token、重定向推送订阅三者要么全成、要么全不成。半途失败会留下&quot;账号里有了但 push 还挂在匿名主体上&quot;的僵尸订阅，之后所有降价提醒都发到了一个没人看的端点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨设备同步与冲突消解\">跨设备同步与冲突消解</h2><p>合并解决的是&quot;一次性身份切换&quot;，跨设备同步解决的是&quot;长期并发写入&quot;。两者的区别在于：合并是<strong>有界窗口</strong>里的批量操作，同步是<strong>无界</strong>的持续对账。</p>\n<p>最常用的两个机制是乐观并发控制与字段级 LWW。乐观并发控制借用 HTTP 条件请求语义：客户端读集合时保留响应头的 <code>ETag</code>，写回时带上 <code>If-Match</code>；服务端只在当前 <code>ETag</code> 一致时应用修改，否则返回 <code>412 Precondition Failed</code>。MDN 与 RFC 9110 都强调 <code>If-Match</code> 使用<strong>强比较</strong>——带 <code>W/</code> 弱前缀的标签永不匹配（<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/If-Match）。这解决的是经典\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/If-Match）。这解决的是经典</a> lost update 问题：两台设备同时改同一条记录，后到的那个不该静默覆盖先到的。</p>\n<p>字段级 LWW 则给每个可冲突字段附一个逻辑时钟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，写入时只在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{new} &gt; c_{cur}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时生效：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c = \\max(c_{client},\\; c_{server}) + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>用 <code>(device_id, counter)</code> 而非墙上时钟做比较——跨境用户的设备时区与系统时间不可信，用 <code>Date.now()</code> 排序会让&quot;时钟快的那台设备&quot;永远赢。若要对集合成员关系做无冲突复制，正确选择是 <strong>OR-Set（observed-remove set）</strong>：每个元素携带一个&quot;添加标记集合&quot;，删除只移除<strong>已观测到的</strong>标记，从而让并发的 add 与 remove 收敛到确定性结果，这正是墓碑机制的理论形式。</p>\n<p>推送订阅的同步有独立约束。Web Push 的订阅端点是一个 <strong>capability URL</strong>——RFC 8030 规定其路径必须包含&quot;至少 120 比特随机熵&quot;，且<strong>不得</strong>跨应用可关联（<a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8030）。这意味着合并时不能复用旧端点当作账号级标识，而应让客户端在合并成功后**重新订阅**，把新端点绑到账号主体。同一条\">https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8030）。这意味着合并时不能复用旧端点当作账号级标识，而应让客户端在合并成功后**重新订阅**，把新端点绑到账号主体。同一条</a> RFC 还规定：<code>TTL</code> 头必填、取 <code>0</code> 时表示&quot;仅当用户代理当前在线才立即投递&quot;、服务端保证不小于 <strong>4096 字节</strong>的载荷不会被 <code>413</code> 拒绝——这些常量直接决定到货提醒的模板大小上限，超出就得改成&quot;推送只放摘要、点击后拉详情&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规与可审计\">合规与可审计</h2><p>匿名态到登录态的合并，在合规上是一次<strong>身份关联</strong>动作：它把一段原本不可归属的行为史，挂到了一个可识别自然人身上。这条链路要在设计时就留下证据。</p>\n<p>GDPR 第 7 条要求控制者能<strong>证明</strong>数据主体同意过处理，且撤回同意&quot;必须与给予同意一样容易&quot;（<a href=\"https://gdpr-info.eu/art-7-gdpr/）。映射到工程上：到货/降价提醒的订阅开关在匿名态和登录态都要可一键关闭，合并时**不能**把匿名态的默认开启继承成账号态的开启——宁可合并后弹一次确认。第\">https://gdpr-info.eu/art-7-gdpr/）。映射到工程上：到货/降价提醒的订阅开关在匿名态和登录态都要可一键关闭，合并时**不能**把匿名态的默认开启继承成账号态的开启——宁可合并后弹一次确认。第</a> 17 条的删除权要求账号删除时连同合并进来的匿名收藏、墓碑记录、推送订阅端点一并清除；只删账号主表、留下关联的匿名档案，等于没删。</p>\n<p>可审计性上至少要记录三件事：<strong>合并事件</strong>（token 哈希、账号、时间、前后条目数、去重数）、<strong>冲突裁决</strong>（哪些字段用了 LWW、依据的逻辑时钟）、<strong>订阅重定向</strong>（旧端点哈希 → 新端点哈希）。三类记录只存<strong>哈希与计数</strong>，不存原始 token 与端点明文——拿到 Web Push 端点就等于可以向该用户推送。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>合并是<strong>并集 + 墓碑过滤</strong>，不是覆盖；没有墓碑，删除过的商品会在下次同步时&quot;复活&quot;。</li>\n<li>去重键首选 <code>variant_id</code>，绝不用前端自增 ID 或时间戳；合并端点必须幂等，用 <code>Idempotency-Key</code> 兜住重试。</li>\n<li>不同字段用不同消解策略：集合成员 add-wins、删除 remove-wins、订阅开关取或、数值取 LWW。</li>\n<li>逻辑时钟用 <code>(device_id, counter)</code>，不要相信跨境设备的墙上时钟；集合并发用 OR-Set 保证收敛。</li>\n<li>合并事务要涵盖&quot;写集合 + 作废匿名 token + 重定向推送订阅&quot;，半成即失败。</li>\n<li>匿名态 token 以服务端为准，localStorage 只做补偿缓存；2026 年还要防<strong>存储分区</strong>导致的内嵌上下文读不到。</li>\n<li>合规上把合并当作身份关联事件来处理：同意可对称撤回、删除要连带清理、审计只留哈希与计数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>同章节的收藏实体建模与去重键定义见 <a href=\"wishlist-item-entity-schema\">心愿单实体与商品收藏建模</a>，合并后的集合如何驱动库存与价格触发，属于后续章节的范畴。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"匿名态与登录态心愿单合并、跨设备同步与冲突消解","id":"匿名态与登录态心愿单合并-跨设备同步与冲突消解"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"匿名态的标识载体与生命周期","id":"匿名态的标识载体与生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"登录合并：并集语义与去重","id":"登录合并-并集语义与去重"},{"level":2,"text":"跨设备同步与冲突消解","id":"跨设备同步与冲突消解"},{"level":2,"text":"合规与可审计","id":"合规与可审计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"心愿单条目实体模型：SKU/变体关联、收藏时间与来源渠道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/wishlist-restock-price-alert-engagement/wishlist-entity-catalog-model/wishlist-item-entity-schema"},"next":{"title":"心愿单分享、公开可见性与隐私合规（删除权与明文治理）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/wishlist-restock-price-alert-engagement/wishlist-entity-catalog-model/wishlist-share-visibility-privacy"}}